OL,3,AOpenAI agent 'infiltrated' Australian
OL,4,Agovernment website, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artificial intelligence agent
OL,7,Fdeveloped by OpenAI "infiltrated" an
OL,8,FAustralian government website in June,
OL,9,FPrime Minister Anthony Albanese has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe agent gained unauthorised accessed
OL,13,Fto a statistics portal containing
OL,14,F"non-sensitive Medicare information",
OL,15,FAlbanese told a news conference at the
OL,16,FUnited Nations General Assembly in New
OL,17,FYork.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
