OL,3,AOpenAI agent 'infiltrated' Australian
OL,4,Agovernment website, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FMedicare refers to Australia's
OL,7,Funiversal healthcare scheme. The breach
OL,8,Fis among the first publicly reported
OL,9,FAI-led hacks of a government website in
OL,10,Fthe world.
OL,12,FOpenAI said it only became aware of the
OL,13,Fincident in August "during an ongoing
OL,14,Freview of OpenAI misaligned model
OL,15,Factivity", and informed Australian
OL,16,Fofficials on 10 September.
